OL,3,AChris Mason: Will Burnham find PMQs as
OL,4,A'nail biting' and 'nerve wracking' as
OL,5,ABlair did?
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe weekly ritual that sits at the
OL,8,Fheart of Westminster's public image
OL,9,Fbeckons, the half an hour or so of
OL,10,Fverbal jousting at Prime Minister's
OL,11,FQuestions (PMQs).
OL,13,FPrime ministerial memoirs tell the
OL,14,Fstories of how central a moment it is
OL,15,Fin the week of any occupant of 10
OL,16,FDowning Street.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
