OL,3,ARising numbers of children in mental
OL,4,Ahealth crisis ending up in A&E
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been a sharp rise in children
OL,7,Fand young people attending A&E units in
OL,8,FEngland in a mental health crisis, NHS
OL,9,Fdoctors are warning.
OL,11,FThe number of six to 17-year-olds
OL,12,Fturning up in significant distress for
OL,13,Fthings like self-harm and eating
OL,14,Fdisorders, or in emotional crisis, rose
OL,15,Fby 36% between 2019 and 2025, according
OL,16,Fto the Royal College of Paediatrics and
OL,17,FChild Health analysis.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
